<title>USA: U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CDT - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CDT - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boxed beef steady to weak on mostly moderate demand and offerings. Select rib, chuck and round cuts steady to weak, while loin cuts weak. Choice rib, chuck and round cuts generally steady, while loin cuts weak. Beef trimmings generally steady on moderate demand and offerings.-USDA</p>
<p>299 Fab Lds  CH 1-3	CH 1-3	SE 1-3	SE 1-3</p>
<p> 68 50s Lds  550/700     700/850     550/700     700/850</p>
<p>25 Grd Lds ---------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Values =     105.96	106.07	 98.62	 98.11</p>
<p>Changes	  -0.14	 -0.02	 -0.42	 -0.23</p>
<p>Rib	  160.19	161.25	149.21	149.84</p>
<p>Chuck	 71.90	 70.99	 72.37	 69.53</p>
<p>Round	 90.87	 90.87	 85.55	 85.55</p>
<p>Loin	 174.39	175.66	150.91	152.19</p>
<p>Brisket     59.06	 59.06	 57.12	 57.12</p>
<p>Shrt Plate  65.31	 65.23	 65.56	 65.39</p>
<p>Flank	 58.69	 58.69	 57.95	 57.95</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
